       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. VERB-MIXED.
      *---------------------------------------------------------------
      * Combination of ADD, SUBTRACT, MULTIPLY, DIVIDE
      * Budget allocation and spending tracker
      *---------------------------------------------------------------
       DATA DIVISION.
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       01  WS-ANNUAL-BUDGET    PIC 9(9)V99  VALUE 500000.00.
       01  WS-NUM-DEPTS        PIC 9(2)     VALUE 5.
       01  WS-BASE-ALLOC       PIC 9(8)V99  VALUE ZEROS.
       01  WS-ALLOC-REMAINDER  PIC 9(6)V99  VALUE ZEROS.
       01  WS-DEPT-SPENT       PIC 9(8)V99  VALUE 85000.00.
       01  WS-DEPT-BUDGET      PIC 9(8)V99  VALUE ZEROS.
       01  WS-REMAINING        PIC S9(8)V99 VALUE ZEROS.
       01  WS-UTIL-PCT         PIC 9(3)V99  VALUE ZEROS.
       01  WS-MONTHLY-ALLOC    PIC 9(7)V99  VALUE ZEROS.
       01  WS-QUARTERLY-ALLOC  PIC 9(8)V99  VALUE ZEROS.
       01  WS-VARIANCE         PIC S9(8)V99 VALUE ZEROS.
       01  WS-ADJUSTMENT       PIC 9(7)V99  VALUE 12500.00.
       01  WS-ADJUSTED-BUDGET  PIC 9(9)V99  VALUE ZEROS.

       PROCEDURE DIVISION.
       MAIN-PARA.
           DIVIDE WS-ANNUAL-BUDGET BY WS-NUM-DEPTS
               GIVING WS-BASE-ALLOC
               REMAINDER WS-ALLOC-REMAINDER
           MOVE WS-BASE-ALLOC TO WS-DEPT-BUDGET
           ADD WS-ADJUSTMENT TO WS-DEPT-BUDGET
           SUBTRACT WS-DEPT-SPENT FROM WS-DEPT-BUDGET
               GIVING WS-REMAINING
           IF WS-DEPT-BUDGET > 0
               DIVIDE WS-DEPT-SPENT BY WS-DEPT-BUDGET
                   GIVING WS-UTIL-PCT
               MULTIPLY 100 BY WS-UTIL-PCT
           END-IF
           DIVIDE WS-DEPT-BUDGET BY 12
               GIVING WS-MONTHLY-ALLOC
           MULTIPLY WS-MONTHLY-ALLOC BY 3
               GIVING WS-QUARTERLY-ALLOC
           SUBTRACT WS-QUARTERLY-ALLOC FROM WS-DEPT-SPENT
               GIVING WS-VARIANCE
           ADD WS-ANNUAL-BUDGET WS-ADJUSTMENT
               GIVING WS-ADJUSTED-BUDGET
           SUBTRACT WS-DEPT-SPENT FROM WS-ADJUSTED-BUDGET
           DISPLAY 'ANNUAL BUDGET: ' WS-ANNUAL-BUDGET
           DISPLAY 'BASE ALLOC:    ' WS-BASE-ALLOC
           DISPLAY 'DEPT BUDGET:   ' WS-DEPT-BUDGET
           DISPLAY 'DEPT SPENT:    ' WS-DEPT-SPENT
           DISPLAY 'REMAINING:     ' WS-REMAINING
           DISPLAY 'UTILIZATION:   ' WS-UTIL-PCT '%'
           DISPLAY 'MONTHLY:       ' WS-MONTHLY-ALLOC
           DISPLAY 'QUARTERLY:     ' WS-QUARTERLY-ALLOC
           DISPLAY 'VARIANCE:      ' WS-VARIANCE
           STOP RUN.
